  "question": {
    "text": "A crystalline solid is made of X, Y and Z. Atoms of X are present in ccp lattice; Y occupies all the octahedral voids and Z occupies all the tetrahedral voids. If all atoms along a body diagonal are removed then the formula of solid will be"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": true
